","text":" will only construct it if the compiled pattern"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"requires reverse matches."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that, if the user code will (possibly) match a string against a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"multitude of patterns containing wildcards, chances are high that","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"some patterns will require a reversed string. In this case, it’s"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"more efficient to provide the reversed string to avoid multiple","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"constructions thereof in the various calls to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"g_pattern_match()"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note also that the reverse of a UTF-8 encoded string can in general"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"not be obtained by [func","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GLib.strreverse"},{"text":"]. This works only if the string","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"does not contain any multibyte characters. GLib offers the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[func"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GLib.utf8_strreverse"},{"text":"] function to reverse UTF-8 encoded strings.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"pattern_match is deprecated:"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use [method@GLib.PatternSpec.match] instead"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/glib\/patternmatch(pspec:stringlength:string:stringreversed:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib"]]},"references":{"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib"